999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.sdk.keyvalue.value.camera</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">获取变焦倍率范围是否连续。如果不连续，表示只能设置关键档位中的数值。 如果连续，则表示可以设置关键档位中最小值和最大值之间的任意数值。 <br>以M3T为例：isContinuous为<code>TRUE</code>，关键档位为：[1,2,4,7,28,56]，表示[1,56]的任意值都可以设置。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading ifm-return-heading\">返回值</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-return-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span></code></span></td><td>返回变焦倍率范围是否连续。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"value_camera_struct_msdkzoomratiosrange_getgears\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#value_camera_struct_msdkzoomratiosrange_getgears_inline\">getGears</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"value_camera_struct_msdkzoomratiosrange_getgears_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getGears</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">int</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">[</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">]</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getGears</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.sdk.keyvalue.value.camera</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=